8733078,2024-04-10,Student loan,Federal student loan servicing,Dealing with your lender or servicer,Received bad information about your loan,"I received IRS form 1099-C copy B from the Internal Revenue Service for discharge by MOHELA and the US Dept of Ed ; however, the subject account still reflects an open status with a balance. 

